-- Checks every verified quote's wording, author and location against the work it cites, using public-domain
-- editions or, for works still in copyright, book-page evidence. Quotes that can't be found in the figure's works
-- are un-verified, so headline matches and the phone's quote library stop offering them. Quotes with the right
-- author get their wording and source corrected to the cited work. seed_quotes.sql already carries these values.
-- Run once in the Supabase SQL Editor, after update_quote_sources.sql and update_recorded_sources.sql.
-- Each statement matches on figure and current text, so re-running changes nothing.
BEGIN;

